'''Darkshot''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually from the [[Darkshot Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or from the [[Darkness Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Halloween Event 2023|2023 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
It takes the design of a magnum revolver, but with a dark, eerie theme to it, and matte black, hence the name. Its barrel is rectangular and is adorned with an elegant, swirly pattern going across the bottom half of it. The handle has a stylish magazine attached to it, and the cylinder/hammer use the same swirly pattern as the barrel.

==Trivia==
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Darksword]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Dark_Set Dark Set].
*This and its partner knife are the seventh gamepass weapons where you had the option to buy it as part of a bundle or separately, the others being [[Waves]], [[Ocean]], [[Rainbow (Godly)|Rainbow]], [[Rainbow Gun (Godly)|Rainbow Gun]], [[Sakura]], [[Blossom]], [[Phantom]], [[Spectre]], [[Plasmablade]], [[Plasmabeam]], [[Pearl]], [[Pearlshine]], [[Iceflake]] and [[Icebeam]].

